  [credentials] provider "beta" (field token): token must be at least 16 characters
  [credentials] provider "delta" (field username): basic authentication requires a username
  [credentials] provider "eta" (field auth): unsupported authentication mode
  [base_url] provider "gamma" (field base_url): base_url must use https when an authentication mode is set
  [credentials] provider "theta" (field username): bearer authentication must not include a username
  [credentials] provider "zeta" (field auth): credentials require an authentication mode
